  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Daily arXiv & Hugging Face Trending AI Research Papers Summary Digest to Slack\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nFetch the top trending AI papers from arXiv and Hugging Face daily, summarize key findings with an LLM, and post to Slack.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/arxiv-hf-paper-summary-citation-extractor`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/arxiv-hf-paper-summary-citation-extractor) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify arXiv & Hugging Face AI Paper Extractor** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "632e916c-47fc-4aa8-ab06-ef1ff272683b",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
